    "02047f4f-c9f0-4458-b5c0-1a8ba45898d0": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "template--18492886057294__02047f4f-c9f0-4458-b5c0-1a8ba45898d0-1680699205ebc800a1-0": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "title": "SPA MENÜ",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "template--18492886057294__02047f4f-c9f0-4458-b5c0-1a8ba45898d0-1680699205ebc800a1-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<p>Zeit für euer Verwöhn-Ritual! Entdeckt unser exklusives Behandlungsangebot für den ganz persönlichen Wohlfühlmoment.</p><p><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0430/2517/0587/files/Judith_Williams_Beauty_World_Spa_Menu_2022.pdf?v=1642434751\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0430/2517/0587/files/Judith_Williams_Beauty_World_Spa_Menu_2022.pdf?v=1642434751\">Hier geht es zum Download.</a></p>"
          }
        }
      },
